<title>USA: Honda May US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Honda May US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			May 1-31, 1997     May 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    55,642	    61,262	     -9.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   3,266	     2,549	    +28.1</p>
<p> Import Car		12,269	    10,412	    +17.8</p>
<p> Import Truck	    10,148	     3,384	   +199.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-May 31, 1997 Jan 1-May 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   254,341	   277,297	     -7.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  11,494	    10,080	    +14.9</p>
<p> Import Car		61,473	    48,684	    +27.3</p>
<p> Import Truck	    36,306	    13,967	   +162.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 128 for year to date vs 129 in year ago.</p>
</text>
